stack software engineer specializing in user experience, user interface, and general well being of the greater web.",{"type":12,"tag":142,"props":190,"children":191},{},[192],{"type":46,"value":193},"Experience spans the majority product lifecycle - from creative to design, through to development, testing and support - coupled with team management.",{"type":12,"tag":142,"props":195,"children":196},{},[197],{"type":46,"value":198},"Further experience with several advanced content management systems, along with social networking integration and mobile development.",{"type":12,"tag":142,"props":200,"children":201},{},[202],{"type":46,"value":203},"High performance, scalable, well architected and executed solutions are always strived for.\nExtra care and attention is applied toward process, tools and continuous integration, and delivery.",{"type":12,"tag":142,"props":205,"children":206},{},[207,209,217],{"type":46,"value":208},"Please visit ",{"type":12,"tag":157,"props":210,"children":214},{"href":211,"rel":212},"https://www.linkedin.com/in/craigbassett/",[213],"nofollow",[215],{"type":46,"value":216},"LinkedIn",{"type":46,"value":218}," for further information on skills and recommendations",{"type":12,"tag":27,"props":220,"children":222},{"title":221},"Work Experience",[223,326,372,394,451,503,518,533],{"type":12,"tag":224,"props":225,"children":230},"Experience",{"company":226,"dates":227,"job-title":228,"website":229},"Quest Software","2016 - Present","Principal Software Engineer","https://quest..com",[231,298,303],{"type":12,"tag":38,"props":232,"children":233},{},[234,257,262,280],{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":235,"children":236},{},[237,239],{"type":46,"value":238},"Created a new Licensing UI\n",{"type":12,"tag":38,"props":240,"children":241},{},[242,247,252],{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":243,"children":244},{},[245],{"type":46,"value":246},"Designed and implemented UX and UI",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":248,"children":249},{},[250],{"type":46,"value":251},"Originally written in Vue2, and re-written in Vue3",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":253,"children":254},{},[255],{"type":46,"value":256},"Defined API endpoints and requirements",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":258,"children":259},{},[260],{"type":46,"value":261},"Helped manage, define, build, and deliver a new component library",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":263,"children":264},{},[265,267],{"type":46,"value":266},"Defined and built an icon library\n",{"type":12,"tag":38,"props":268,"children":269},{},[270,275],{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":271,"children":272},{},[273],{"type":46,"value":274},"Included multiple avenues of consumption to allow any team to use",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":276,"children":277},{},[278],{"type":46,"value":279},"Consumption paths included npm, cloning the source or downloading svg's for use in marketing material",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":281,"children":282},{},[283,285],{"type":46,"value":284},"Developed a new Angular 2 App\n",{"type":12,"tag":38,"props":286,"children":287},{},[288,293],{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":289,"children":290},{},[291],{"type":46,"value":292},"Developed a NodeJS Express API",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":294,"children":295},{},[296],{"type":46,"value":297},"Included gulp pipelines, tests and associated work in order to nurture continuous integration and delivery",{"type":12,"tag":142,"props":299,"children":300},{},[301],{"type":46,"value":302},"Notable achievements;",{"type":12,"tag":38,"props":304,"children":305},{},[306,311,316,321],{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":307,"children":308},{},[309],{"type":46,"value":310},"New UI Framework learnings, Vue, Vuetify, Quaser, Vue-Query",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":312,"children":313},{},[314],{"type":46,"value":315},"Successfully completed transition to Quest Software from Dell Software.",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":317,"children":318},{},[319],{"type":46,"value":320},"Further learnings with Angular2 and TypeScript.",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":322,"children":323},{},[324],{"type":46,"value":325},"Alignment with legacy .NET codebase.",{"type":12,"tag":224,"props":327,"children":331},{"company":328,"dates":329,"job-title":228,"website":330},"Dell","2014 - 2016","https://dell.com",[332,360,364],{"type":12,"tag":38,"props":333,"children":334},{},[335,340,345,350,355],{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":336,"children":337},{},[338],{"type":46,"value":339},"Manage, define and police all code in the RESTful component of the Dell Cloud Manager product. This component provides the data and interface to and from the User Interface and backend components.",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":341,"children":342},{},[343],{"type":46,"value":344},"Contributing to Dell's best practice for RESTful API's and implementation requirements given our technical platform.",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":346,"children":347},{},[348],{"type":46,"value":349},"Serve as the Technical Manager for front end engineering and operations as a point of contact with the back end, product and quality teams. I liaise with other team leads to manage daily features, bugs and general workflows. Product roadmaps and planning are also discussed daily.",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":351,"children":352},{},[353],{"type":46,"value":354},"Possess a rare and intimate knowledge of the Cloud and Dell Cloud Manager across the full technology stack, and serve as a point of contact for all teams when required - especially where concerning the RESTful API or Angular UI applications. ",{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":356,"children":357},{},[358],{"type":46,"value":359},"Oversee and manage Creative Design requirements in the product - which involves a direct and intimate relationship with the UX and Product Management teams. This particular function ensures that the vision prescribed by UX is met in the final delivery of changes by our team.",{"type":12,"tag":142,"props":361,"children":362},{},[363],{"type":46,"value":302},{"type":12,"tag":38,"props":365,"children":366},{},[367],{"type":12,"tag":42,"props":368,"children":369},{},[370],{